WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.750
Every night ends... with the same question.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.200
How do I get home?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.160
Now... the ride home goes on your bill.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.860
Quoted before you book. You see the most it can be.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.130
One bill. Nothing to download.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.800
You walk out... with the ride already booked.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.240
Go out. Enjoy the night.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:40.100
RideNite. The ride home goes on the venue bill.

